<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In recent years, Thinknyx Technologies has attained significant milestones as a leading training and development organization. Providing an extensive range of training programs in cutting-edge technologies, we experienced a growth of 18% in program diversity. Our dedication to participant satisfaction is evident, achieving a 97% approval rate through post-training surveys. Our instructors, with an average of 10+ years of industry experience, contributed to a 15% increase in certified trainers. Embracing digital trends, we observed a 45% rise in online training sessions. With a global presence spanning 10+ countries, we accomplished a 6% increase in international engagements. Strategic collaborations with industry leaders led to a 30% boost in revenue. Success stories abound, with 12% of participants obtaining certifications, fostering 32% growth in certified professionals. Thinknyx Technologies remains a recognized industry leader, extending our commitments beyond business success through impactful community initiatives and free workshops that have benefited 45,000+ individuals.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [0]
>>
